Lab 3 – Scikit-learn Preprocessing and Model Evaluation

Name: Dishi Shah
ID: 202618051
Dataset: Hotel Booking Demand Dataset

Objective: Build and compare two preprocessing pipelines using StandardScaler and MinMaxScaler with Logistic Regression and Decision Tree models.

Work Done
* Handled missing values and removed data leakage columns.
* Created two preprocessing pipelines.
* Trained four model-pipeline combinations.
* Evaluated models using Accuracy, Precision, Recall, and F1-score.
* Compared results and checked for overfitting using train-test performance.
* Plotted confusion matrices for the best models.

Tools
Python, Pandas, NumPy, Matplotlib, Seaborn, and Scikit-learn.
